{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That dastardly cat Mr. Skritch has trapped your birdie friends inside magical gems - and now he's cackling with glee! Join Sandy on a delightful treasure hunt across the enchanting Komio Island to rescue every single Bird-Buddy before Skritch's mischievous minions cause even more trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 hand-crafted worlds where curiosity is rewarded and every corner hides a surprise. From hidden passages to secret powerups, this cozy adventure celebrates the joy of discovery rather than punishing precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of wonderfully weird abilities - bounce with Bubble-Seeds, stomp with Bomb-Boots, electrify with Mag-Zaps, wreck everything with Axe-Bones or gallop on Dashing Ponies. The ultra-rare ScootyCopter awaits the most dedicated explorers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an army of adorable troublemakers as you climb toward the ultimate showdown atop Mt. Skritch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome love letter to classic platformers, lovingly crafted by a solo developer with a passion for colourful worlds full of surprises.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598570?t=1749413588","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/5a97d78860d438159b08ee36be62bdaa18dad8b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749413588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/189c6a5ce87500e0352beaf972777d7db4fa32c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749413588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/189c6a5ce87500e0352beaf972777d7db4fa32c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749413588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3802040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That dastardly cat Mr. Skritch has trapped your birdie friends inside magical gems - and now he's cackling with glee! Join Sandy on a delightful treasure hunt across the enchanting Komio Island to rescue every single Bird-Buddy before Skritch's mischievous minions cause even more trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 hand-crafted worlds where curiosity is rewarded and every corner hides a surprise. From hidden passages to secret powerups, this cozy adventure celebrates the joy of discovery rather than punishing precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of wonderfully weird abilities - bounce with Bubble-Seeds, stomp with Bomb-Boots, electrify with Mag-Zaps, wreck everything with Axe-Bones or gallop on Dashing Ponies. The ultra-rare ScootyCopter awaits the most dedicated explorers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an army of adorable troublemakers as you climb toward the ultimate showdown atop Mt. Skritch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome love letter to classic platformers, lovingly crafted by a solo developer with a passion for colourful worlds full of surprises.</p>","developers":["FiveChook"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598570/5078a81e391ef7e8f881684d283c7cd6cb63661b/header.jpg?t=1749413588","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom